T*
0 Tw
0.986942 Tw
(faith\054 of holiness\054 or of any other good quality and disposition\054 as though it were) Tj
T*
0 Tw
-0.00138 Tw
(based on a prerequisite cause or condition in the person to be chosen\054 but rather for) Tj
T*
0 Tw
0.650725 Tw
(the purpose of faith\054 of the obedience of faith\054 of holiness\054 and so on\056 Accordingly\054) Tj
T*
