0.984849 Tw
(election is the source of each of the benefits of salvation\056 Faith\054 holiness\054 and the) Tj
T*
0 Tw
0.359948 Tw
(other saving gifts\054 and at last eternal life itself\054 flow forth from election as its fruits) Tj
