T*
0 Tw
2.098229 Tw
(over all\054 is good\054 and does good unto all\054 and is therefore to be feared\054 loved\054) Tj
T*
0 Tw
0.009687 Tw
(praised\054 called upon\054 trusted in\054 and served\054 with all the heart\054 and with all the soul\054) Tj
T*
0 Tw
1.675419 Tw
(and with all the might\056 But the acceptable way of worshipping the true God is) Tj
T*
0 Tw
0.502526 Tw
(instituted by Himself\054 and so limited by His own revealed will\054 that He may not be) Tj
T*
0 Tw
0.656854 Tw
(worshipped according to the imaginations and devices of men\054 or the suggestions) Tj
T*
0 Tw
0.769892 Tw
(of Satan\054 under any visible representation\054 or any other way not prescribed in the) Tj
T*
0 Tw
(holy Scripture\056) Tj
